 * ============================================================
 * CONFIG.GS — Central configuration & schema definitions
 * ============================================================
 * Adding a new module/table later only requires adding an
 * entry here, then a matching *.gs module and *.html page.
 * This object is also the single source of truth you'll use
 * to generate CREATE TABLE statements when migrating to MySQL.
 * ============================================================
 */

