   * 2026" — set up by the admin, then used by Hub Managers to file
   * dated projects against. Quarter + YearLabel are never duplicated as
   * a combo (see validateQuotaInput in Quotas.gs); the display label
   * ("Q1 2026") is always computed from the two fields rather than
   * stored redundantly.
   *
   * ProjectYear/QuarterStart/QuarterEnd added later: quarters used to be
   * a fixed Jan-Apr/May-Aug/Sep-Dec calendar split derived from YearLabel
   * alone (still the fallback for any older quota row that predates these
   * columns — see getQuotaDateRange_ in Quotas.gs). New quotas store their
   * actual date range directly, so a "quarter" can start/end whenever a
   * project's real cycle does, not just on calendar-quarter boundaries.
   * ProjectYear is a separate free-text label (not necessarily "YYYY")
   * from YearLabel, which stays for backward-compatible display/sorting.
   */
  ReportingQuotas: {
    sheetName: 'ReportingQuotas',
    primaryKey: 'QuotaID',
    idPrefix: 'Q',
    idPadding: 3,
    columns: ['QuotaID', 'Quarter', 'YearLabel', 'Status', 'DateCreated', 'DateModified', 'ProjectYear', 'QuarterStart', 'QuarterEnd'],
    searchableColumns: ['Quarter', 'YearLabel', 'ProjectYear'],
